<title>USA: IPO FILING-Big Dog Holdings Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Big Dog Holdings Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Big Dog Holdings Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			BDOG.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.8 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  700,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,960,550</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  525,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Santa Barbara, Calif., Big Dog develops, markets and retails a branded, lifestyle collection of unique, high-quality, popular-priced consumer products, including activewear, casual sportswear, accessories and gifts.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To reduce indebtedness and for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
